From: n0madic <800462+n0madic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:28:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Emulate the SPU2 so the game's own LIBSD.IRX produces sound

Upstream PR #308 (open). The SPU2 also runs while the IOP idles, so an
IRQA hit wakes a thread waiting for it.
